// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_mshta_http.yml
// ID Sigma: b98d0db6-511d-45de-ad02-e82a98729620
// Título: Remotely Hosted HTA File Executed Via Mshta.EXE
// Descripción: Detects execution of the "mshta" utility with an argument containing the "http" keyword, which could indicate that an attacker is executing a remotely hosted malicious hta file
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: high
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_mshta_http.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\mshta.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "MSHTA.EXE") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "http://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "https://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "ftp://")
